### Check first
Open [this component](/#/components/{{componentUrnForUrl}}/highlights) and its [metrics](/#/components/{{componentUrnForUrl}}/metrics). Inspect HTTP 4xx/5xx statuses, requested collections and client errors. The configured threshold is **{{threshold}}** in the monitor chart's unit.

### Likely causes
Missing collections, invalid payloads, authentication failures or server errors.

### Fix
Fix the failing endpoint or collection access; check server logs for 5xx responses.

### Verify
The HTTP failure rate returns to zero while successful operations continue. If samples are absent, investigate the exporter and Collector: this threshold check cannot establish healthy operation without data.
